---
// Head.astro
// Drop this inside <head> on any page that uses the dark/gem design system.
//
// Font change: Syne → Sora for headings. Syne's exaggerated, quirky curves
// read more "crypto landing page" than "privacy software company" — Sora
// keeps the geometric, confident feel but sits closer to what you'd see on
// a serious infra/security product (Linear, Vercel, etc. use similar
// geometric sans stacks). Inter stays for body copy, it's already solid.
//
// Only the weights actually used in the design are loaded (600/700/800 for
// Sora, 300/400/500 for Inter) instead of the full default range — smaller
// download, less font-parsing/layout work per visitor.
---

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link
  href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap"
  rel="stylesheet"
/>

<style is:global>
  :root {
    --fd: "Sora", sans-serif;
    --fb: "Inter", sans-serif;
  }
</style>
